      ],
      "source": "https://alchetron.com/Alpine%2C-Colorado-%28ghost-town%29",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Elk, deer, big‑horn sheep, bears, and even mountain lions roam the forest that encircles Alpine.",
